attribution: Traditional American murder ballad, sung from the 1890s and in print by 1912; the words are stanzas 1, 6 and 7 as collected in Carl Sandburg's The American Songbag (1927). Public domain: traditional, published before 1931 (United States) and no individual author (Canada).
source_url: https://archive.org/details/americansongbag029895mbp
tags: standard, 1910s, blues, ballad, folk
